{"title":"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A jacket and a shirt originally sold for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> dollars and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> dollars, respectively.  During a sale Chris bought the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> dollar jacket at a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/e/f4e4e5c6d549ce47918b94180cad5c1644d9ea88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> discount and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> dollar shirt at a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/3/57325e811c0dc6a9aaf80534a15cf62d74ec38b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> discount.  The total amount saved was what percent of the total of the original prices?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/b/64b0ee65e133671d1dafc92f9203ef1e1ea0830d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 45\\% \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 47\\dfrac{1}{2}\\% \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 50\\% \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 79\\dfrac{1}{6}\\% \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 95\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"477\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Chris would have spent <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/4/6941cf27fe20c5cb61961b367ed55b51cf044aeb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40 + 80 = 120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"109\" height=\"14\" /> dollars if there were no sale.\n</p><p>The sale means that he saved <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/6/2e65e485857b75aba0afe23c4a629dbfbaeb8466.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80(0.40) + 40(0.55) = 32 + 22 = 54$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"276\" height=\"18\" /> dollars.\n</p><p>He saved <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/2/3426ae03250a5640deb207737f5d0507e6944cb6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{54}{120}\\cdot 100\\% = 0.45 \\cdot 100\\% = 45\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"255\" height=\"38\" /> off the total of the original prices, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6eb65962292d994ce2f9a8af63728883f256b18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"27\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME\" title=\"1995 AJHSME\">1995 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem